Package: qpwnagotchi
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Vlad Ananyev <vlananyev@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libxkbcommon0, libfontconfig1, libgl1, libegl1, libdbus-1-3, libnss3, libxcb-cursor0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vladsever/qPwnagotchi
Description: PyQt6 manager for your own Pwnagotchi over SSH
 qPwnagotchi is a small desktop GUI to manage your own Pwnagotchi device
 over SSH: status (uptime/disk/ip), service control, logs, config edit
 with backup, SFTP upload/download, reboot/shutdown. Intentionally does
 not provide features for offensive actions.
